{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf44d0675add1792c7dea2a552e96004","RawContent":"I am on CC! :) there&#039;s a lot of great info there too. [quote name=\"dst8\"]\nLove this - its nice to tie a bit of the cruise lingo into the invites :) I also noticed you are on the \"CC\" site - I feel like there is so much to do ......[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1800003,"PostDate":1379114352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am on CC! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> there's a lot of great info there too. <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"dst8\" url=\"\/t\/87004\/rsvp&#045;language&#045;for&#045;cruise&#045;wedding&#045;in&#045;port#post_1946704\"><p>Love this - its nice to tie a bit of the cruise lingo into the invites <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I also noticed you are on the \"CC\" site - I feel like there is so much to do ......<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinacavanaugh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.87.40.1","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369072692,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tinkerbell82","Id":269788,"Name":"Tinkerbell82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74716,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7f6c35ddb58f092410a25af3e5cf48a","RawContent":"We are worried about this too. Fingers are crossed, but if it comes down to it we will have to tell our B listers that they have to sail or they cant go. We invited about 120- so far we have 8 cabins booked (18 sailing guests) and 16 for sure not sailing. [quote name=\"Budgirl194\"]\nI am having an issue with wording because carnival is only allowing us to have a amall # of people come on for the wedding and then get off before we sail. We are inviting alot of people in hopes that most will cruise with us, but I am nervous with how we word the newsletter we are sending out in place of an invitation because I dont want more then our allowed # of people thinking they can come for just the wedding and leave, and then we end up having to turn people down. Any suggestions? Thanks!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1800006,"PostDate":1379114554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are worried about this too. Fingers are crossed, but if it comes down to it we will have to tell our B listers that they have to sail or they cant go. We invited about 120- so far we have 8 cabins booked (18 sailing guests) and 16 for sure not sailing. <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Budgirl194\" url=\"\/t\/87004\/rsvp&#045;language&#045;for&#045;cruise&#045;wedding&#045;in&#045;port#post_1947026\"><p>I am having an issue with wording because carnival is only allowing us to have a amall # of people come on for the wedding and then get off before we sail. We are inviting alot of people in hopes that most will cruise with us, but I am nervous with how we word the newsletter we are sending out in place of an invitation because I dont want more then our allowed # of people thinking they can come for just the wedding and leave, and then we end up having to turn people down. Any suggestions? Thanks!!<\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinacavanaugh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.87.40.1","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369072692,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tinkerbell82","Id":269788,"Name":"Tinkerbell82","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
