{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cbc4f43c454729e80b962f7c7cfc4569","RawContent":"I don&#039;t have a close up of my ring, and I couldn&#039;t find the exact band on the Tacori website, but it&#039;s a Tacori platinum with 1.5ct round center and some pave and tooling on the sides.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/myring.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/70222\/width\/525\/height\/525\/flags\/LL\"&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1390,"PostDate":1159025000,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I don't have a close up of my ring, and I couldn't find the exact band on the Tacori website, but it's a Tacori platinum with 1.5ct round center and some pave and tooling on the sides.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/myring.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/70222\/width\/525\/height\/525\/flags\/LL\"><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aq