{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":668,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914993,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287430,"Name":"christine89","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1469227678,"LastPoster":{"Id":287546,"Name":"JennyPH","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1914993,"PostDate":1469227678,"PostContent":"Dear fellow users. I want to tell you that dressilyme sent me my dream wedding gown. I hope more...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mou32sumi@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"202.142.101.157","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1469226813,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"christine89","Id":287430,"Name":"christine89","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"202.142.101.157","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80209,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b8baec66c67c4f7c0ab66c1270bc839","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;Dear fellow users. I want to tell you that dressilyme sent me my dream wedding gown. I hope more brides will feel the way I did at my wedding day. The quality and craftsmanship of wedding gown is AMAZING. &amp;nbsp;My process included providing pictures of the dress I wished for (as it was not within the standard selection profile), and Dressilyme was able to create the dress perfectly.&amp;nbsp; Dressilyme was able to 1) match the exact design of the dress 2) use the correct quality material i.e. silk bodice, silk organza train etc... 3) measurements\/dress size was accurate 4) send within the exact timeline and 5) had wonderful customer service to answer questions and provide status updates.&amp;nbsp; The original dress would have cost me $1800 from the bridal store (plus at least $500 in tailoring), Dressilyme charged $189 plus $30 for custom measurements.   I can&#039;t express my gratitude to be able to have a dream dress for a fraction of the price.&amp;nbsp; Weddings are expensive and Dresssilyme helps to manage the cos of a wedding dress.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;A very happy wife, Christine&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":36271,"Name":"7e57f5d4-ed65-45e8-9ce7-4ee0be4fdf8e-115-160.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287430-0-84002100-1469241928.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287430-0-84002100-1469241928_thumb.jpg","Width":115,"Height":160},{"Id":36272,"Name":"37dbdb73-e800-455e-9aa3-fc8e38b9acd7-115-160.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287430-0-11313600-1469241930.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287430-0-11313600-1469241930_thumb.jpg","Width":115,"Height":160},{"Id":36273,"Name":"237758d8-a2eb-4773-882f-0c428f4abe0e-115-160.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287430-0-15261900-1469241931.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287430-0-15261900-1469241931_thumb.jpg","Width":115,"Height":160},{"Id":36274,"Name":"e95ac773-949e-4c39-a52f-a59c8b57ac07-115-160.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287430-0-45687400-1469241932.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287430-0-45687400-1469241932_thumb.jpg","Width":115,"Height":160}],"Id":1914993,"PostDate":1469227678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\">Dear fellow users. I want to tell you that dressilyme sent me my dream wedding gown. I hope more brides will feel the way I did at my wedding day. The quality and craftsmanship of wedding gown is AMAZING. \u00a0My process included providing pictures of the dress I wished for (as it was not within the standard selection profile), and Dressilyme was able to create the dress perfectly.\u00a0 Dressilyme was able to 1) match the exact design of the dress 2) use the correct quality material i.e. silk bodice, silk organza train etc... 3) measurements\/dress size was accurate 4) send within the exact timeline and 5) had wonderful customer service to answer questions and provide status updates.\u00a0 The original dress would have cost me $1800 from the bridal store (plus at least $500 in tailoring), Dressilyme charged $189 plus $30 for custom measurements.\u00a0\u00a0 I can't express my gratitude to be able to have a dream dress for a fraction of the price.\u00a0 Weddings are expensive and Dresssilyme helps to manage the cos of a wedding dress.<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\">A very happy wife, Christine<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mou32sumi@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"202.142.101.157","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1469226813,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"christine89","Id":287430,"Name":"christine89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"117.247.211.156","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80209,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c8b9abc039d76cd52e582d32ff6a34a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations! I am glad to see to you happy. Now, your wedding decoration should match with your look. I would like to see your wedding venue, wedding decorations. Would you please share the pictures with me.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914995,"PostDate":1469240959,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations! I am glad to see to you happy. Now, your wedding decoration should match with your look. I would like to see your wedding venue, wedding decorations. Would you please share the pictures with me.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanessahodge26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"117.247.211.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465793553,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Venessa26","Id":287136,"Name":"Venessa26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"117.247.211.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80209,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Venessa26, 29 July 2016 - 04:49 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1469767797,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c78245470f663f34acf632a8a453fc05","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Venessa26\" post=\"1914995\" timestamp=\"1469255359\"]\nCongratulations! I am glad to see to you happy. Now, your wedding decoration should match with your look. I would like to see your wedding venue, wedding decorations. Would you please share the pictures with me?  You can have long island wedding if you want to save money. There are many[url=\"http:\/\/www.leonardspalazzo.com\/\"] li wedding venues in NY [\/url]that are affordable and can help you to save a lot.[\/quote][quote name=\"Venessa26\" post=\"1915085\" timestamp=\"1469782074\"]\n[quote name=\"Venessa26\" post=\"1914995\" timestamp=\"1469255359\"]\n\n[\/quote][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1915085,"PostDate":1469767777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Venessa26, on 23 July 2016 - 02:29 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congratulations! I am glad to see to you happy. Now, your wedding decoration should match with your look. I would like to see your wedding venue, wedding decorations. Would you please share the pictures with me?\u00a0 You can have long island wedding if you want to save money. There are many<a href='http:\/\/www.leonardspalazzo.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'> li wedding venues in NY <\/a>that are affordable and can help you to save a lot.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Venessa26, on 29 July 2016 - 04:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Venessa26\" data-cid=\"1914995\" data-time=\"1469255359\">\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanessahodge26@gmail.com","IpAddress":"117.247.211.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465793553,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Venessa26","Id":287136,"Name":"Venessa26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.248.122.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80209,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddc8c7068e34e8d6bde7e218e6dab2ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! You are so beautifull&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915093,"PostDate":1469797337,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! You are so beautifull<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.teesfair.com'>http:\/\/www.teesfair.com<\/a>\u00a0<\/span>TEESFAIR.COM is a rich resources of world's best T-Shirts. It is specially or refers to an online shop for T-Shirts. We prioritize your interests, occasions, hobbies and passion for making or displaying t-shirts. We design tees on various themes like fathers day, mothers day, hunting t-shirts, camping t-shirts, fishing, boating t-shirts,funny t shirts, custom t shirts and so on. We find and collect the top and current trends t-shirts and bring it in front of you from different platforms. Our main mission is to bring our customer's passions into life by helping them express themselves and connect with others through our unique design T-Shirts. These largest collections, best and unique design T-Shirts are designed by a global community of independent designers. Our website also offers the ability for customers to create their own individualized T-Shirts, providing infinite possibilities. All our tees are screen printed on soft, high quality, 100% cotton.","Email":"ameealan11@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.248.122.14","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1469432068,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ameealan11","Id":287450,"Name":"ameealan11","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.246.109.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80209,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fe3720c306aa8e35682c83e9aa21198","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations! You look amazing in that dress. I bought my wedding dress and bridesmaid dresses from Dressilyme as well. Attached my wedding photos. :D&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/d72e0544-b832-4009-a73a-796b4dcba361.JPG\" alt=\"d72e0544-b832-4009-a73a-796b4dcba361.JPG\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img3.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/af7f1c64-49b0-4a52-bb97-ed38f819fe2d.JPG\" alt=\"af7f1c64-49b0-4a52-bb97-ed38f819fe2d.JPG\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img2.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/55cf19f4-17bf-44b8-9a7c-bef5872fd5ba.JPG\" alt=\"55cf19f4-17bf-44b8-9a7c-bef5872fd5ba.JPG\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img1.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/e903c704-63a8-4e13-8bab-882837e29d92.JPG\" alt=\"e903c704-63a8-4e13-8bab-882837e29d92.JPG\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img1.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/bd3a6aad-c08f-446c-bc27-9d7ecef92fd5.JPG\" alt=\"bd3a6aad-c08f-446c-bc27-9d7ecef92fd5.JPG\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915273,"PostDate":1470894197,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations! You look amazing in that dress. I bought my wedding dress and bridesmaid dresses from Dressilyme as well. Attached my wedding photos. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/d72e0544-b832-4009-a73a-796b4dcba361.JPG\" alt=\"d72e0544-b832-4009-a73a-796b4dcba361.JPG\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img3.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/af7f1c64-49b0-4a52-bb97-ed38f819fe2d.JPG\" alt=\"af7f1c64-49b0-4a52-bb97-ed38f819fe2d.JPG\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img2.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/55cf19f4-17bf-44b8-9a7c-bef5872fd5ba.JPG\" alt=\"55cf19f4-17bf-44b8-9a7c-bef5872fd5ba.JPG\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img1.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/e903c704-63a8-4e13-8bab-882837e29d92.JPG\" alt=\"e903c704-63a8-4e13-8bab-882837e29d92.JPG\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img1.dressilyme.net\/review\/19290\/bd3a6aad-c08f-446c-bc27-9d7ecef92fd5.JPG\" alt=\"bd3a6aad-c08f-446c-bc27-9d7ecef92fd5.JPG\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah160802@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.246.109.145","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1470891824,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JennyPH","Id":287546,"Name":"JennyPH","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80209","Title":"I Felt Like A Queen On My Wedding Day, Thanks To Dressilyme","LastPostDate":1470894197},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
