rder=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I&#039;m in trouble then... the dress models are all 6&#039; and 95lbs... I love the slimmer, form-fitting dresses too.\n I plan to go barefoot, am 5&#039;4&amp;quot;, athletic 125lbs.&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/muscle.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Muscle\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n Maybe I&#039;ll do the bikini and sarong thing. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thatswck.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"that&#039;s wack\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I&#039;m with you - 5&#039;4&amp;quot; and well, maybe more than 125 - lol - but I&#039;m still going with &amp;quot;athletic!&amp;quot; \n \n Don&#039;t you just want to feed those models? They look so hungry!","Attachments":[],"Id":23104,"PostDate":1170448114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>lbourassa<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I'm in trouble then... the dress models are all 6' and 95lbs... I love the slimmer, form-fitting dresses too.<br \/> I plan to go barefoot, am 5'4\", athletic 125lbs.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/muscle.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Muscle\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> Maybe I'll do the bikini and sarong thing. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thatswck.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"that's wack\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I'm with you - 5'4\" and well, maybe more than 125 - lol - but I'm still going with \"athletic!\" <br \/> <br \/> Don't you just want to feed those models? They look so hungry!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161378480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0e25cf2c09aa5cd85d6ec161ca751d1","RawContent":"ROFL.. So much to say Ann.. must hold back..","Attachments":[],"Id":23109,"PostDate":1170449344,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                ROFL.. So much to say Ann.. must hold back..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmooney74@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1148663520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206746.jpg?_r=1394162525","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":184,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyB","Id":206746,"Name":"TammyB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cc29ca8f7c05520d617c66636300eb5","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;gkashmira&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Edyta, Janet you guys look great!\n \n Okay, here&#039;s mine (Janet, this model weighs about 100 pounds less than me too... well not 100 but a lot!). The model looks different in the dress - better in some places (tiny waist, long legs) worse in others (she&#039;s flat chested and I&#039;m not &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;)\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/kashmirasdress.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/Wedding%20Dress\/Scarlet_front.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Where is that dress from?? I absolutely LOVE it!!!\n and it looks beautiful on you!!","Attachments":[],"Id":23110,"PostDate":1170450194,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>gkashmira<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Edyta, Janet you guys look great!<br \/> <br \/> Okay, here's mine (Janet, this model weighs about 100 pounds less than me too... well not 100 but a lot!). The model looks different in the dress - better in some places (tiny waist, long legs) worse in others (she's flat chested and I'm not <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>)<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/kashmirasdress.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/Wedding%20Dress\/Scarlet_front.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Where is that dress from?? I absolutely LOVE it!!!<br \/> and it looks beautiful on you!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;125\/st\/20070401\/e\/engagement%3F%3F%3F\/dt\/-2\/k\/1104\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...1104\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"llbourassa@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1169411696,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207085.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lbourassa","Id":207085,"Name":"lbourassa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2727e2666b9821d3291dcbfaa0dbc5e7","RawContent":"I&#039;m also 5&#039;4!!!! Except I&#039;m about a deuce, a deuce and a half. Ok I don&#039;t know why but wedding dress shopping does not appeal to me. I never look for dresses and I have no desires to buy one. I am actually dreading it! But you guys all look great in your dresses!!! My sister says that models do the peeing pose b\/c it makes you look skinnier since you hunch your shoulders foward to make the bones on your neck pop out. (My sister is quasi anorexic) It&#039;s so funny b\/c I think &amp;quot;real&amp;quot; brides look so much better but girls here love the ano look where you have no boobs, or a butt and you look emaciated like your arms are going to fall off. A lot of people strive for that look here. I think it&#039;s Hollywoods influence.\n \n -Glenda","Attachments":[],"Id":23111,"PostDate":1170450323,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm also 5'4!!!! Except I'm about a deuce, a deuce and a half. Ok I don't know why but wedding dress shopping does not appeal to me. I never look for dresses and I have no desires to buy one. I am actually dreading it! But you guys all look great in your dresses!!! My sister says that models do the peeing pose b\/c it makes you look skinnier since you hunch your shoulders foward to make the bones on your neck pop out. (My sister is quasi anorexic) It's so funny b\/c I think \"real\" brides look so much better but girls here love the ano look where you have no boobs, or a butt and you look emaciated like your arms are going to fall off. A lot of people strive for that look here. I think it's Hollywoods influence.<br \/> <br \/> -Glenda\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanitysmuf@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1166574660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206982.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":66,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nrvsbride","Id":206982,"Name":"Nrvsbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b118dea2ee6b093c7e3175f98f559d67","RawContent":"i&#039;ve never been accused of being anorexic - that&#039;s for sure. well, maybe high school - but that was loooooong ago! i always joke that i am partially bulimic (sp?) - I binge, I just don&#039;t purge. Ok, I know it&#039;s not a joking matter - but that&#039;s how I explain my eating habits!","Attachments":[],"Id":23113,"PostDate":1170450717,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i've never been accused of being anorexic - that's for sure. well, maybe high school - but that was loooooong ago! i always joke that i am partially bulimic (sp?) - I binge, I just don't purge. Ok, I know it's not a joking matter - but that's how I explain my eating habits!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161378480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bec5f629522303a2985b6e3d2b79bd2","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;akh&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;i&#039;ve never been accused of being anorexic - that&#039;s for sure. well, maybe high school - but that was loooooong ago! i always joke that i am partially bulimic (sp?) - I binge, I just don&#039;t purge. Ok, I know it&#039;s not a joking matter - but that&#039;s how I explain my eating habits!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I have to make jokes about everything or else I will go crazy. This is a sad world we are living in today and if we didn&#039;t have humor and had to take everything seriously then we would all breakdown and have nervous breakdowns. So I say joke away. (Except that I realized that it is possible that someone on this board could have an eating disorder in which case my comments don&#039;t seem so funny anymore.)\n \n -Glenda","Attachments":[],"Id":23132,"PostDate":1170454935,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>akh<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">i've never been accused of being anorexic - that's for sure. well, maybe high school - but that was loooooong ago! i always joke that i am partially bulimic (sp?) - I binge, I just don't purge. Ok, I know it's not a joking matter - but that's how I explain my eating habits!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I have to make jokes about everything or else I will go crazy. This is a sad world we are living in today and if we didn't have humor and had to take everything seriously then we would all breakdown and have nervous breakdowns. So I say joke away. (Except that I realized that it is possible that someone on this board could have an eating disorder in which case my comments don't seem so funny anymore.)<br \/> <br \/> -Glenda\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanitysmuf@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1166574660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206982.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":66,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nrvsbride","Id":206982,"Name":"Nrvsbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e57498e3f901a044a99d5a8a75a6eec1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lbourassa&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Where is that dress from?? I absolutely LOVE it!!!\n and it looks beautiful on you!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;The dress is Monique Lhuillier and the style is &amp;quot;Scarlet&amp;quot;\n I am literally obsessed with my dress (you can ask the other ladies - they know and are so sick of hearing about it I&#039;m sure!) but I also paid a lot for it (I have someone buying it from me after my wedding to make back some of the $$$)","Attachments":[],"Id":23158,"PostDate":1170458426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>lbourassa<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Where is that dress from?? I absolutely LOVE it!!!<br \/> and it looks beautiful on you!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>The dress is Monique Lhuillier and the style is \"Scarlet\"<br \/> I am literally obsessed with my dress (you can ask the other ladies - they know and are so sick of hearing about it I'm sure!) but I also paid a lot for it (I have someone buying it from me after my wedding to make back some of the $$$)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kashmira & Dan<\/span><br><span>Happily married since June 16, 2007<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/IMG_0769.jpg\">http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l1...a\/IMG_0769.jpg<\/a><br><span>Our mini-video: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html\">http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html<\/a><br><span>Photo slideshow: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php\">http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"gkashmira@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1156793160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206698.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gkashmira","Id":206698,"Name":"gkashmira","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":832,"TotalPages":84,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":830},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
