:"347b2838fc49fcfacc52f4489621d9ad","RawContent":"Wow - Ameebs - you look amazing. I love that dress. I am completely obsessed with Maggie Sottero gowns. I am desperately wanting to try on the Maggie Sottero Mia Lynette but its old and no one has a sample in FL.","Attachments":[],"Id":25073,"PostDate":1171125522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow - Ameebs - you look amazing. I love that dress. I am completely obsessed with Maggie Sottero gowns. I am desperately wanting to try on the Maggie Sottero Mia Lynette but its old and no one has a sample in FL.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i74.photobucket.com\/albums\/i251\/tob1kanobe\/tobypics025-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i74.photobucket.com\/albums\/i2...ypics025-1.jpg<\/a><br><span>Bryan (DH) is Napolean Dynamite and his friend is a keg.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tob1kanobe@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1171061760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207145.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tob1kanobe","Id":207145,"Name":"tob1kanobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a1257c16ec4324a57b652849b55bb32","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;EDYTA&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Kash - u already have a buyer?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Yup. I listed that i was going to sell it after my June wedding and another bride based in DC was looking for the same dress. Anyway, so she&#039;s going to buy it afterwards. I&#039;m happy to be making back more than 1\/2 the money BUT I have to admit I&#039;m a little sad about letting it go!","Attachments":[],"Id":25154,"PostDate":1171164810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>EDYTA<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Kash - u already have a buyer?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Yup. I listed that i was going to sell it after my June weddi