alse}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d30a57a25a2805588f511b45f3f49da","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;LC_Rachel&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;You can barely tell the difference in the dresses. You look great Julie! I loved that dress...especially since I nearly bought it. :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I did add the halter strap and cut out the silk on the train and just leave the lace, so I made it my own as well. I never even tried on the Maggie, I did not know it existed till I posted my dress and someone else posted the Maggie and I realised it was a knock off.","Attachments":[],"Id":137569,"PostDate":1194736605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>LC_Rachel<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">You can barely tell the difference in the dresses. You look great Julie! I loved that dress...especially since I nearly bought it. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I did add the halter strap and cut out the silk on the train and just leave the lace, so I made it my own as well. I never even tried on the Maggie, I did not know it existed till I posted my dress and someone else posted the Maggie and I realised it was a knock off.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"graberjul@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.33.230.91","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1168108500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207027.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":283,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JulieG","Id":207027,"Name":"JulieG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"238652f4a381ab1fe0b92c6557cdcd7f","RawContent":"I love these type of posts. All you ladies look fantastic. Now is my turn to play. I ordered my dress in light gold over diamond white but the sample in this pic is diamond white over diamond white.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i203.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa280\/DW_PV_Bride2B\/J1083.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i203.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa280\/DW_PV_Bride2B\/Anastasia_Back.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i203.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa280\/DW_PV_Bride2B\/IMG_1158_Nov18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":137611,"PostDate":1194749578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love these type of posts. All you ladies look fantastic. Now is my turn to play. I ordered my dress in light gold over diamond white but the sample in this pic is diamond white over diamond white.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i203.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa280\/DW_PV_Bride2B\/J1083.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i203.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa280\/DW_PV_Bride2B\/Anastasia_Back.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i203.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa280\/DW_PV_Bride2B\/IMG_1158_Nov18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nat@nat1.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1174877940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cd