  <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177534500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e25de27c15528833f946579e93062beb","RawContent":"Do not resize them Carly, they are a good size. I think you look stunning in that dress. I am so glad you decided on this one. I can&#039;t wait to see you in it all done up. Man I wish all you girls were getting married sooner, I spend too much time on this forum now and I am already married. Get married already so I don&#039;t lose my new job because I am still on here everyday. lol","Attachments":[],"Id":139829,"PostDate":1195227593,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Do not resize them Carly, they are a good size. I think you look stunning in that dress. I am so glad you decided on this one. I can't wait to see you in it all done up. Man I wish all you girls were getting married sooner, I spend too much time on this forum now and I am already married. Get married already so I don't lose my new job because I am still on here everyday. lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"graberjul@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.33.230.91","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1168108500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207027.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":283,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JulieG","Id":207027,"Name":"JulieG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c701263aa96517b7d6222c01e3ac641","RawContent":"Thanks, Julie! I love seeing &amp;quot;real&amp;quot; people in the dresses. I had seen this dress on teh model in a magazine and on the website and I didn&#039;t even take another glance at it. In person it was just gorgeous. I made my final payment and just waiting for the check to clear and I can pick it up! I am afraid that when I pick it up, I will need to try it on every morning, every night when i get home from work and then again before I go to bed. That is, if I can take it off at all! Hhahahahaaa.\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Julesr&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Do not resize them Carly, they are a good size. I think you look stunning in that dress. I am so glad you decided on this one. I can&#039;t wait to see you in it all done up. Man I wish all you girls were getting married sooner, I spend too much time on this forum now and I am already married. Get married already so I don&#039;t lose my new job because I am still on here everyday. lol&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":139831,"PostDate":1195227818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks, Julie! I love seeing \"real\" people in the dresses. I had seen this dress on teh model in a magazine and on the website and I didn't even take another glance at it. In person it was just gorgeous. I made my final payment and just waiting for the check to clear and I can pick it up! I am afraid that when I pick it up, I will need to try it on every morning, every night when i get home from work and then again before I go to bed. That is, if I can take it off at all! Hhahahahaaa.<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Julesr<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Do not resize them Carly, they are a good size. I think you look stunning in that dress. I am so glad you decided on this one. I can't wait to see you in it all done up. Man I wish all you girls were getting married sooner, I spend too much time on this forum now and I am already married. Get married already so I don't lose my new job because I am still on here everyday. lol<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177534500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":832,"TotalPages":84,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":830},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
