e,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ecc1835a9e3d981322a1fe1dde3f313","RawContent":"Carly, I commented on your dress when you first posted it here, but wow- it&#039;s so beautiful. Love the veil with it too! I can&#039;t wait to see your wedding either.\n \n Heidi, have you posted your dress here? Gosh, I&#039;ve had to have viewed 1000&#039;s of them. I can&#039;t wait to see you in it so hurry up and get your camera back.","Attachments":[],"Id":139886,"PostDate":1195235597,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Carly, I commented on your dress when you first posted it here, but wow- it's so beautiful. Love the veil with it too! I can't wait to see your wedding either.<br \/> <br \/> Heidi, have you posted your dress here? Gosh, I've had to have viewed 1000's of them. I can't wait to see you in it so hurry up and get your camera back.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married since 2008<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rachie021@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.173.241.167","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1179191760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207401.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jajajaja","Id":207401,"Name":"jajajaja","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14291d72f5bd6101e0a2b3876c38b735","RawContent":"Thanks, Rachel! I can&#039;t wait to get it either. It won&#039;t be real until I OWN it. My sis and I are going to make the veil, we are replicating the look of that one (but with no sparkles), so I hope it turns out well!\n \n I can&#039;t remmber Heidi&#039;s either, so I really hope she remmbers her camera!\n \n Wasn&#039;t there a photobucket account created for BDW? It would be nice if we could all post our pics in one place and not have to weed thru the comments...","Attachments":[],"Id":139892,"PostDate":1195236128,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks, Rachel! I can't wait to get it either. It won't be real until I OWN it. My sis and I are going to make the veil, we are replicating the look of that one (but with no sparkles), so I hope it turns out well!<br \/> <br \/> I can't remmber Heidi's either, so I really hope she remmbers her camera!<br \/> <br \/> Wasn't there a photobucket account created for BDW? It would be nice if we could all post our pics in one place and not have to weed thru the comments...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177534500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1700,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fd9276c0985e783c5f8c32d863d6fc0","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i204.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb312\/amynyland\/modeldress1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i204.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb312\/amynyland\/modeldress2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The Model Pics\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i204.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb312\/amynyland\/Dress8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i204.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb312\/amynyland\/Dress9.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Me........\n These are the ones before, without the alterations I&#039;m having done (sweetheart neckline) and (bottom needs to be alot shorter)","Attachments":[],"Id":139921,"PostDate":1195240671,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n           